    "title": "County Road 172 closed in Bullard road widening project - NewsBreak",
    "text": "BULLARD, Texas ( KETK ) – The Texas Department of Transportation has announced a County Road 172 closure in Bullard starting Wednesday, Aug. 13. The road closure is expected to last about a month while crews work on the FM 2493 widening project. TxDOT has marked detours with signs and electric message boards that will assist drivers in the area. The department said Bullard ISD bus routes should not be changed by the closure. You can now stream KETK and FOX51 News live 24/7 on your smart TV with KETK+ , our brand-new app! No antenna, cable, or satellite needed— watch for free, anytime. Just download it on your Roku, Apple TV, or Fire TV and start streaming. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KETK.com | FOX51.com.",
